WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,580
What does Baoan mean?

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,780
Kill with sword

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:10,580
But he can obviously directly support these guys, senior masters

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:13,980
Save us, far away, I was wrong

5
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:16,210
For the sake of us being old classmates

6
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:19,310
Please save us, you old monster

7
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:21,990
Recovery is slower when you get older, so what?

8
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:23,190
Just hold on a little longer

9
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:25,790
After resting, I'll go rescue you guys.

10
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:28,590
Do you really want Zheng Guiju and the others to die?

11
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:30,270
Then I won't be polite
